1
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:54,500
Old Tao.

2
00:00:55,120 --> 00:00:56,300
There really is a task force,

3
00:00:57,820 --> 00:00:58,860
and they're coming after us.

4
00:00:59,680 --> 00:01:00,720
Yeah.

5
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:12,800
Mr. Lu, why don't you have a seat?

6
00:01:13,820 --> 00:01:15,660
You must give me an explanation today.

7
00:01:18,960 --> 00:01:20,240
Right now, we are being watched by

8
00:01:20,860 --> 00:01:22,220
the Discipline and Inspection Committee.

9
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:24,120
If we stick to our old ways,

10
00:01:24,440 --> 00:01:25,840
we'll walk straight into a trap.

11
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:27,340
What do you mean?

12
00:01:30,020 --> 00:01:30,860
Lay low for now.

13
00:01:31,160 --> 00:01:34,080
For Lu'an Energy's headquarters bidding,

14
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:36,680
we'll follow standard procedures.

15
00:01:37,220 --> 00:01:38,220
Fair competition.

16
00:01:38,940 --> 00:01:39,840
Bullshit!

17
00:01:40,540 --> 00:01:41,900
I spent so much damn money!

18
00:01:42,060 --> 00:01:44,080
Over ten million in hard cash invested!

19
00:01:44,160 --> 00:01:44,960
Old Lu,

20
00:01:45,880 --> 00:01:46,780
calm down.

21
00:01:47,860 --> 00:01:49,060
Doing business

22
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:51,440
isn't like buying groceries at the market,

23
00:01:51,960 --> 00:01:53,600
obsessing over a few scallions.

24
00:01:56,380 --> 00:01:57,020
Mr. Du,

25
00:01:57,600 --> 00:01:58,780
please don't take offense.

26
00:02:00,100 --> 00:02:02,260
Old Lu invested hard cash,

27
00:02:02,660 --> 00:02:04,100
that's tangible and real.

28
00:02:04,940 --> 00:02:06,780
What I've put on the line is just as real.

29
00:02:07,380 --> 00:02:09,680
Political capital, favors owed.

30
00:02:10,480 --> 00:02:12,160
We operate in a circle,

31
00:02:12,500 --> 00:02:15,600
where we build bridges for each other

32
00:02:15,980 --> 00:02:17,220
and help each other succeed.

33
00:02:18,180 --> 00:02:19,220
But after all this fuss,

34
00:02:21,100 --> 00:02:22,100
if there's no payoff,

35
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,080
then who

36
00:02:25,380 --> 00:02:27,560
will still cover for you in the shadows?

37
00:02:27,940 --> 00:02:30,380
Who else would bail you out of trouble?

38
00:02:30,780 --> 00:02:31,500
Mr. Du,

39
00:02:32,140 --> 00:02:33,020
don't get me wrong.

40
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:34,420
To be blunt,

41
00:02:34,580 --> 00:02:36,280
none of us have clean hands.

42
00:02:36,940 --> 00:02:37,960
If we

43
00:02:38,220 --> 00:02:38,980
back out now,

44
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:40,560
will we really land safely?

45
00:02:41,160 --> 00:02:42,980
Will everything in the past be wiped clean?

46
00:02:46,420 --> 00:02:47,500
That's why they say

47
00:02:47,940 --> 00:02:49,980
you see things clearest, Mr. Lu.

48
00:02:51,100 --> 00:02:51,920
Why don't

49
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:54,300
you point us to a way out?

50
00:02:55,020 --> 00:02:56,260
In this situation,

51
00:02:56,820 --> 00:02:58,060
what should we do?

52
00:03:03,220 --> 00:03:04,320
The way I see it,

53
00:03:04,980 --> 00:03:06,180
with how things are,

54
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:07,720
we can only push through.

55
00:03:08,180 --> 00:03:10,580
But we can't rely solely on Mr. Du.

56
00:03:11,540 --> 00:03:15,220
You two are incredibly well-connected.

57
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:18,260
Use your ties to dismantle the task force—

58
00:03:18,340 --> 00:03:19,620
it's not impossible.

59
00:03:26,620 --> 00:03:27,420
Young Master Qin.

60
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:32,900
Young Master Qin.

61
00:03:33,780 --> 00:03:34,240
Okay.

62
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:35,920
Understood.

63
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:37,960
What did he say?

64
00:03:39,900 --> 00:03:41,180
Young Master Qin asked me to relay:

65
00:03:42,260 --> 00:03:43,060
he'll hold the fort,

66
00:03:44,020 --> 00:03:45,060
and we push through.

67
00:03:48,380 --> 00:03:50,340
Mr. Lu, Mr. Tao.

68
00:03:51,860 --> 00:03:52,720
Since

69
00:03:53,300 --> 00:03:54,220
things have come to this,

70
00:03:54,980 --> 00:03:56,700
let's each work our magic

71
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:58,780
and break this impasse together.

72
00:04:01,220 --> 00:04:02,360
Alright.

73
00:04:03,020 --> 00:04:03,860
Then we push through together.

74
00:04:04,420 --> 00:04:05,340
We either land safely,

75
00:04:08,180 --> 00:04:09,400
or if we can't push through,

76
00:04:10,200 --> 00:04:11,540
the worst is we all go down together.

77
00:04:41,340 --> 00:04:41,760
Hello?

78
00:04:41,960 --> 00:04:42,520
Mr. Du.

79
00:04:42,900 --> 00:04:44,140
What are our chances?

80
00:04:45,260 --> 00:04:46,160
Hard to say.

81
00:04:48,420 --> 00:04:50,260
Young Master Qin can hold the fort,

82
00:04:51,020 --> 00:04:52,780
but he can't cover everyone's eyes.

83
00:04:53,460 --> 00:04:55,060
The task force has sweeping authority,

84
00:04:55,420 --> 00:04:56,460
but we're backed by the top brass.

85
00:04:57,180 --> 00:04:59,420
Besides, the tree behind Young Master Qin

86
00:04:59,660 --> 00:05:00,680
has very deep roots.

87
00:05:01,820 --> 00:05:03,960
It's great if he can cover for us.

88
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:07,580
Didn't we muscle through the last round too?

89
00:05:08,260 --> 00:05:09,280
You're keeping yourself

90
00:05:09,380 --> 00:05:10,360
wound far too tight.

91
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:14,240
I hope I'm just overthinking it.

92
00:05:18,540 --> 00:05:19,360
Gong Jianlin's—

93
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:19,980
Chief.

94
00:05:22,300 --> 00:05:24,100
Du Qingbo, Lu Qiming, and Tao Xinliang

95
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:26,060
met at a hotel in the northern suburbs.

96
00:05:27,260 --> 00:05:30,460
Are they trying to push through or back off?

97
00:05:30,940 --> 00:05:33,700
What's the deal with Tao Xinliang and Lu Qiming?

98
00:05:33,780 --> 00:05:35,040
In recent years, Tao Xinliang

99
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:36,820
has been running things at Lu'an Energy.

100
00:05:37,100 --> 00:05:38,620
Lu Qiming is our city's

101
00:05:38,620 --> 00:05:40,220
biggest real estate developer.

102
00:05:40,660 --> 00:05:43,300
Their past projects were also suspicious,

103
00:05:43,380 --> 00:05:44,980
but to avoid alerting them,

104
00:05:44,980 --> 00:05:45,780
we haven't investigated them closely yet.

105
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:47,560
Keep digging deeper.

106
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:49,040
Don't just stick to this one lead.

107
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,280
Pursue multiple leads in parallel.

108
00:05:50,320 --> 00:05:51,280
Investigate all the way to the bottom.

109
00:05:51,640 --> 00:05:52,160
Yes, sir.

110
00:05:57,300 --> 00:05:57,680
Mom.

111
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:01,560
Auntie, come join in and exercise with them.

112
00:06:02,260 --> 00:06:02,960
Not me, I can't.

113
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:04,740
I don't have an athletic bone in my body.

114
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:05,620
It's fine.

115
00:06:05,620 --> 00:06:06,560
I really can't do it.

116
00:06:07,080 --> 00:06:07,840
Come on, come over here.

117
00:06:07,980 --> 00:06:08,920
I'll hold your bag for you.

118
00:06:09,620 --> 00:06:11,300
That's it, just follow his movements.

119
00:06:11,760 --> 00:06:12,340
Qing.

120
00:06:16,940 --> 00:06:17,740
What do you think?

121
00:06:17,820 --> 00:06:20,840
This is the best nursing home in Jianzhou.

122
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:22,180
I know.

123
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:24,480
It must cost a fortune every month.

124
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:26,900
Don't worry about the money.

125
00:06:27,440 --> 00:06:28,940
I've already reserved a spot for Mom.

126
00:06:29,320 --> 00:06:30,260
I appreciate your kind intentions,

127
00:06:30,260 --> 00:06:31,100
but I can't accept this.

128
00:06:31,140 --> 00:06:31,820
This is definitely out of the question.

129
00:06:33,140 --> 00:06:34,900
Why are you treating me like an outsider?

130
00:06:35,900 --> 00:06:37,100
When my family had trouble back then,

131
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:39,120
I freeloaded at your place a lot.

132
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:41,200
Besides, Mom helped raise Yanyan too.

133
00:06:41,940 --> 00:06:43,100
That's a completely different matter.

134
00:06:46,100 --> 00:06:46,800
Hello?

135
00:06:46,880 --> 00:06:47,380
Hello.

136
00:06:47,700 --> 00:06:48,200
Mr. Du.

137
00:06:49,280 --> 00:06:50,560
Have the guests been taken care of?

138
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:52,720
Yes, they're with Young Master Qin now.

139
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:56,040
Take good care of them for me.

140
00:06:56,740 --> 00:07:00,160
And don't disturb our local friends.

141
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:01,720
Rest assured, Mr. Du.

142
00:07:10,500 --> 00:07:11,300
Qingbo,

143
00:07:12,260 --> 00:07:13,440
there's something

144
00:07:14,320 --> 00:07:15,360
I still need to tell you.

145
00:07:17,340 --> 00:07:18,860
If you keep walking down this path,

146
00:07:19,380 --> 00:07:20,820
it won't end well.

147
00:07:22,740 --> 00:07:24,140
You studied law.

148
00:07:24,140 --> 00:07:25,260
You should understand this.

149
00:07:32,980 --> 00:07:34,360
I think...

150
00:07:36,020 --> 00:07:38,100
I think I'm doing just fine on this path.

151
00:07:41,820 --> 00:07:43,180
The kind of life I lived back then,

152
00:07:43,180 --> 00:07:44,220
it's not like you don't know.

153
00:07:44,660 --> 00:07:46,220
Now I have whatever I want.

154
00:07:46,740 --> 00:07:49,000
I can take care of everyone around me.

155
00:07:50,940 --> 00:07:52,120
Just focus on your work.

156
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:53,420
Your modest government agency

157
00:07:53,420 --> 00:07:54,860
doesn't pay much all year round.

158
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:56,960
Leave taking care of Mom to me.

159
00:08:03,420 --> 00:08:04,120
Qing.

160
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:05,060
Son.

161
00:08:05,760 --> 00:08:06,080
Mom.

162
00:08:06,500 --> 00:08:07,160
Take a look.

163
00:08:07,740 --> 00:08:08,060
How is it?

164
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:08,800
Mom,

165
00:08:08,840 --> 00:08:09,440
how did you do?

166
00:08:09,440 --> 00:08:10,140
Not bad, not bad.

167
00:08:10,580 --> 00:08:11,220
How is it, Mom?

168
00:08:11,260 --> 00:08:11,860
Do you like it?

169
00:08:11,980 --> 00:08:13,820
If you like it, we'll move you in today.

170
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:15,400
It's a nice place,

171
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:16,500
and the environment is lovely.

172
00:08:16,500 --> 00:08:16,860
Of course.

173
00:08:16,980 --> 00:08:17,780
But still,

174
00:08:18,060 --> 00:08:20,160
I feel more comfortable at home.

175
00:08:21,260 --> 00:08:23,580
Besides, Geng Qing is busy with work.

176
00:08:23,760 --> 00:08:26,020
I have to cook for him when he gets home.

177
00:08:26,540 --> 00:08:27,420
That's too much trouble.

178
00:08:27,420 --> 00:08:28,500
It's exhausting for you.

179
00:08:28,780 --> 00:08:31,420
I've seen your progress all these years.

180
00:08:31,520 --> 00:08:32,780
Making money isn't easy.

181
00:08:33,220 --> 00:08:34,520
Don't go squandering it.

182
00:08:35,300 --> 00:08:36,300
Don't worry, Mom.

183
00:08:36,700 --> 00:08:39,060
I'm doing well now; I don't lack money.

184
00:08:40,500 --> 00:08:44,220
Qingbo, you can never earn all the money.

185
00:08:44,820 --> 00:08:46,340
Seeing how busy you've been,

186
00:08:46,800 --> 00:08:48,240
it breaks my heart.

187
00:08:48,980 --> 00:08:50,220
In this life,

188
00:08:50,740 --> 00:08:52,140
one shouldn't seek great wealth.

189
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:54,360
We only hope for peace and safety,

190
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:57,300
and a hot meal when we get home.

191
00:08:58,460 --> 00:08:59,420
Take some time

192
00:08:59,420 --> 00:09:00,740
to spend with Yanyan.

193
00:09:01,100 --> 00:09:03,540
Children grow up in the blink of an eye.

194
00:09:04,880 --> 00:09:05,340
All right.

195
00:09:05,880 --> 00:09:06,340
Mom.

196
00:09:06,680 --> 00:09:08,700
Well then, I'll head back now.

197
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:09,180
Wait,

198
00:09:09,180 --> 00:09:11,740
Mom, reconsider. It's really nice here.

199
00:09:11,800 --> 00:09:12,380
No need.

200
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:13,880
Qing,

201
00:09:14,100 --> 00:09:15,020
what about you? Are you heading back?

202
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:15,660
I'm going home.

203
00:09:16,460 --> 00:09:19,180
I can have my driver give you a ride.

204
00:09:19,180 --> 00:09:19,800
No need.

205
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:20,700
We

206
00:09:21,740 --> 00:09:22,460
aren't going the same way.

207
00:09:23,520 --> 00:09:24,000
Let's go, Mom.

208
00:09:25,300 --> 00:09:25,860
Thank you.

209
00:09:26,580 --> 00:09:27,860
If you ever like this place,

210
00:09:28,180 --> 00:09:30,180
we can always come visit when we're free.

211
00:09:30,220 --> 00:09:30,840
Sounds good.

212
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:33,640
Your father

213
00:09:34,380 --> 00:09:36,020
has been retired for several years.

214
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:38,100
He never asks about my work.

215
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:39,340
Yet these past couple of days,

216
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:41,600
an old comrade suddenly came to him,

217
00:09:41,880 --> 00:09:42,640
saying

218
00:09:42,780 --> 00:09:45,140
he heard I'm investigating the bidding,

219
00:09:45,700 --> 00:09:46,860
and asked us to give them a way out.

220
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:51,760
He spent ages on the phone last night.

221
00:09:53,420 --> 00:09:55,420
Your former superior pleaded with you?

222
00:09:55,700 --> 00:09:57,220
Someone asked him to pass a message to me,

223
00:09:57,260 --> 00:09:58,380
hoping we would ease up.

224
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:01,340
Lately, all sorts of monsters

225
00:10:01,420 --> 00:10:04,200
and shady figures have surfaced.

226
00:10:04,340 --> 00:10:06,780
Trying to push through, eh, Director Liu?

227
00:10:07,020 --> 00:10:08,540
Secretary Luo, I have something to report.

228
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:11,820
My graduate advisor retired long ago,

229
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:14,460
yet someone approached him to pull strings recently.

230
00:10:16,540 --> 00:10:17,340
All right.

231
00:10:18,180 --> 00:10:21,840
How big of a figure will this implicate?

232
00:10:22,180 --> 00:10:23,900
I'm getting more and more curious.

233
00:10:24,700 --> 00:10:27,540
Ties with mentors, colleagues, and old friends...

234
00:10:27,900 --> 00:10:29,520
These personal ties are hard to overcome.

235
00:10:30,140 --> 00:10:31,060
Right, comrades?

236
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:33,260
I hope all of you keep your priorities straight.

237
00:10:33,380 --> 00:10:34,540
Needless to say,

238
00:10:34,780 --> 00:10:37,200
I expect all comrades to withstand the pressure

239
00:10:37,300 --> 00:10:38,020
and never bow down.

240
00:10:38,120 --> 00:10:39,060
Yes, sir!
